<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.3">
<l>peyyum pūṅkuḻal pēymulai yuṇṭa piḷḷait tēṟṟamum pērntōr cāṭiṟac</l>
<l>ceyya pātamoṉ ṟālceyta niṉciṟuc cēvakamum</l>
<l>neyyuṇ vārttaiyu ḷaṉṉai kōlkoḷḷa nīyuṉ ṟāmaraik kaṇka ṇīrmalka</l>
<l>paiyavē nilaiyum vanteṉ ṉeñcai yurukkuṅkaḷē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The self-assurance of the child that ate from the breast of the demoness, [her] curls with flowers that she wore,</l>
<l>your little service that was done with one red foot so that the one cart was annihilated [and] died,</l>
<l>[your] state when your lotus eyes abounded in tears as [your] mother took the stick in the butter-eating business</l>
<l>come softly [and] make my heart melt.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
